scope: |
  The Char-to-Int boundary fix landed in b672b0d41 and passed focused local gates, but exact-SHA
  conformance run 30286311782 exposed a JS regression in multi-parameter typed lambdas:
  entry normalization assigns to immutable `const [a, b]` bindings, causing three standard-library
  conformance cases to exit with `TypeError: Assignment to constant variable`. Fix 57d107739 uses
  mutable destructuring only when normalization is present; the minimal fail-first regression and
  all three exact CI witnesses are green, and CrossBackendPropertyTest is 17/17.
next: Land BUGS/SPRINT/CHANGELOG bookkeeping, inspect CI evidence for 57d107739, then release under AGENTS.md rule 4c and remove the worktree.
